# FastAPI currently requires no secrets or .env file.
# Run from ml-service/ so bundled models resolve from the application directory:
# python -m uvicorn app:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
# The backend calls this address through ML_SERVICE_URL in backend/.env.
# Models and the active-model.json pointer are in ml-service/models/.
# Optional Ollama is configured in backend/.env, not in this service.
